      "message": "We all appear to need the same central 5\u00d75, so repeated overwriting will only waste actions. I propose a stable row split: Blue keeps y=3..4, Green takes y=5, and I take y=6..7, all within x=3..7. I\u2019ll respect those boundaries if you do.",
